### Sample REST Client for testing requests

### Get all notes
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/4

### Post a new note
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons/ HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "name": "sample",
    "number": "388-123-4567"
}
### PUT a note
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/persons/4 HTTP/1.1